   "text": "Bournemouth International College - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBournemouth International College - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBournemouth University is a careers-focused institution with fantastic teaching. Successful completion of the foundation course will lead to entry to a degree at Bournemouth University. Every student who comes to BU can benefit from the university's innovative, forward-thinking environment. Its industry-relevant degrees, work placements and support services are designed to give students skills that help make them globally employable. Students at BU will fall in love with its beautiful location on England's sunny south coast. It's an area with lots to see and do, and makes for a fun, active and inexpensive student lifestyle.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:32\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:24\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £20,510.00\nMin: £12,511.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n1,760 of 16,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nBournemouth\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IuHK7uOxuKc\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
